WEBVTT

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.610
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:06.030
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.600
This time, Lulu-chan's grandmother app-

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.470
Granny's actually comin'? Hoo boy...

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.190
And you guys don't seem the least bit worried...

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:16.150
Hey, what are you doing here?

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:19.760
Yeah, yeah! You're not 
supposed to show up yet!

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.800
I have a feeling things will be 
exciting right from the start.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.790
Doki!

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:28.180
Yes! Yes!

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.100
Let's go!

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:34.110
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.900
Shugo, shugo! Yes!

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:45.600
Swing your arms! Hop, step, jump!

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:50.140
Now start marching straight ahead!

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:53.750
Way too awesome! Yes!

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.270
Every dream I've ever had!

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:02.980
Since they're all actually coming true.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:09.100
What kind of person will I be today?

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:14.390
What counts is being true to yourself!

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:18.540
Going somewhere?

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.960
Take it to the finish!

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:24.450
You'll always be able to

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.390
unlock your heart.

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:30.350
So keep on changing!

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:32.760
It's so exciting!

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:40.890
Let's go forward, believing in our hearts!

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.620
Straight ahead!

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:45.280
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:01.850
Look at all the stalls they have here!

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:03.310
There's yakisoba!

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:04.850
And takoyaki, too!

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.440
Amu-chan, let's try them all!

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.680
No way, I'm on a diet right now.

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:11.030
We're just here to look.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.010
I'm sorry!

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:17.590
Please think about the 
trouble you cause others.

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:18.820
Yes, Ma'am!

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.100
Who's that?

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.520
A foreigner?

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:23.470
Yeah right!

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:24.440
You've got to be joking!

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:27.660
You two over there, cease that 
boorish behavior at once!

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:28.810
Y-Yes, Ma'am!

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.320
Throw it in the trash bin!

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.060
Right!

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:36.810
For goodness' sake, what is 
becoming of Japan's youth?

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:38.520
She's really intense.

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:40.020
You there!

00:02:45.110 --> 00:02:48.350
Might I find the house of the Morcerf 
family in this vicinity?

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.540
Morcerf? You mean...

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:52.220
Lulu?

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:57.220
Episode 72
All Shook Up! The Grandmother Appears!!

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:00.690
So you came all the way from France?

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:01.220
Yes.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.000
You're really good at Japanese...

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.330
As a viscountess, it is only natural.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.930
Right...

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:11.930
So this is Lulu's grandma?

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:15.830
By the way, something has been bothering me.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:19.560
What are you doing in such sloppy attire?

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.860
Sloppy?

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:23.940
This is just my style...

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:26.060
Tuck in your shirt this instant!

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:27.630
Right away!

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:31.840
Amu-chan...

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:34.410
She criticized my sense of style.

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.310
Feelin' good!

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:40.570
This commercial is very darned excellent!

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:41.970
Thank you, honey!

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:43.530
Maman...

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.930
Papa...

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:47.140
I wonder what Grandmother would say if she saw it.

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:50.190
Maman, please forgive me!

00:03:50.190 --> 00:03:52.200
Mother, I'm sorry!

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:55.640
Grandmother is in Paris. There's no way 
she'd be here, right?

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:57.450
Lulu?

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:59.140
I'm just joking, like always.

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:02.140
Yeah, darn straight!

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.650
Coming!

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:07.150
Nice to see you again.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:08.960
Oh, welcome!

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:10.270
Maman, for heaven's sake!

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.550
Don't go outside wearing those clo-

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.350
Hinamori Amu!

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.530
Lulu is precisely correct.

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:20.860
That voice...

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.140
Maman, what's going on?

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:29.790
Noriko-san, we aristocrats must 
always maintain proper dress.

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:32.130
Grandmother!

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:42.990
This is kind of awkward...

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.450
Hinamori-san.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:45.970
Yes?

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:50.350
My family has not been together for quite 
some time, so if you wouldn't mind...

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:52.380
R-Right, yeah!

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:53.720
She needn't go.

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:57.650
I must repay you for guiding me here.

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:00.870
It is common aristocratic courtesy.

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:03.610
But of course, Grandmother!

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.840
O-Okay then...

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:07.910
A true aristocrat!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.150
She's perfectly refined.

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:11.890
It ain't such a good thing...

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:13.600
Noriko-san.

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:14.450
Yes?

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:16.970
This tea is delightful.

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:18.750
Thank you very much.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.340
However!

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:25.290
Isn't this decor a bit... common for 
the household of a first-class chef?

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.020
<i>This</i> is common?

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:30.510
Son, how many servants do you have?

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:33.330
Maman, please understand, this is Japan...

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:34.970
This is the house of an aristocrat!

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:38.260
It is only natural to have a servant or two!

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:40.000
I'm sorry...

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.570
Grandmother!

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:47.820
Speaking of which, 
they were handing these out.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.380
Ah, that's...

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.050
That commercial's the 
talk of our whole school.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:53.280
Really?

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:53.770
Yeah!

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.740
Deplorable!

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:59.520
You would never have stooped to this 
level when you were an actress in Paris!

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:00.970
Forgive me...

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:05.360
Have you two abandoned 
your aristocratic pride?

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:07.830
Could it be that you fled my strict tutelage

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:11.390
so you could cavort to your 
heart's content here in Japan?

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.810
No, we didn't! You're mistaken!

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:15.540
Silence, both of you!

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:18.510
Excellent, Grandmother!

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:22.230
You're saying exactly what I've 
been thinking every single day!

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:23.740
Lulu!

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:25.530
They both seem fine to me,

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.970
and your mom looks like she's having fun.

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:31.610
Hush, Hinamori-san! 
Get a clue already!

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:33.510
Sorry...

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:36.020
Thanks for the food!

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:40.700
Mmm, delicious!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.140
Thank you!

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.180
Feelin' good!

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:47.560
Feewin' good!

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:50.320
Feewin' good!

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.370
Ami-chan, you're so cute!

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:54.700
Good 'n cute!

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:57.510
If Lulu's grandmother saw this...

00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:59.690
I think she'd get mad.

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:06.930
Maman believes we ran 
away from her to Japan.

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:07.800
But actually...

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:09.350
We are in the middle of a meal.

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:12.390
What are you whispering about?

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:15.410
Papa, Maman, this is an 
excellent opportunity.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.970
Perhaps you should consider changing 
the way things look around here?

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:20.360
Lulu... what's the matter?

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:22.220
You're not acting like yourself.

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:25.100
I am exactly as I always am.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.240
Everything will go as planned, right?

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:34.640
You can count on us!

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:37.750
We'll prove that we can get the Embryo!

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:40.600
Let's get the simulation started!

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:52.750
Ikuto!

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:55.180
What is it? Are you okay?

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:57.930
Don't worry about it.

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:17.460
It's been a while, but the 
milk-guzzling girl is back!

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:20.270
Powers you up, day by day!

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:22.070
But she's supposed to be the heroine...

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:24.580
Nana!

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:28.380
What's the matter?

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:31.390
But wait, how do you know 
where Amu-chan's house is?

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:34.740
I researched that a 
heck of a long time ago.

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:38.100
Anyway, Lulu's in big trouble, y'all!

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:39.470
She is?

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:41.890
Y'all saw her granny!

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:46.270
She's always been smothered by 
that lady's perfectionist dogma!

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:48.540
And that's bad for Lulu?

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:52.440
Lulu's gonna be totally influenced 
by that there granny!

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:55.430
What'll I do?! If Lulu goes back 
to how she used to be...

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:59.450
When Lulu gets obsessed, 
she usually turns real stuck-up!

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:01.540
That's why I'm always telling her...

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:04.560
"Get a move on! Get goin'!"

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:07.970
It'll be fine.

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:11.840
I'm sure Lulu's grandmother just 
wants what's best for her.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:15.420
And I thought y'all might 
actually be some help...

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:17.910
Anyway! When y'all have a guest,

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:22.020
ain't it common sense to offer them 
some tea or a stick of uiro at least?!

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:23.980
What kind of common sense is that?

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:26.690
You just came over uninvited 
yelling "-nya -nya -nya-"

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.720
Not -nya! It's y'all, yeah!

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:30.470
Whatever! What's the difference?

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:31.770
What'd y'all say?

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:34.320
Nya nya nya, I'm saying nya!

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:35.270
Y'all are pissin' me off!

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:41.110
Thank you so much 
for coming, Grandmother.

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:45.760
I was feeling like I had forgotten a bit 
of the pride of being an aristocrat.

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:51.870
Lulu, how do you like Japan?

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:53.350
Have you settled in?

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:55.470
Yes, Grandmother!

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.690
Are you still drawing?

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:59.580
Drawing?

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:03.490
You used to draw many 
pictures and show them to me.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.310
You said you wanted to 
become an artist.

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:08.080
Did I?

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.080
You also adored picture books.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:13.680
You spoke of wanting to write 
stories when you grew-

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:16.150
That was all when I was just a child.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.170
It embarrasses me now.

00:10:18.570 --> 00:10:21.160
You're making jewelry, I see.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:22.500
Yes.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:26.540
But lately, I haven't been able to 
make anything I'm satisfied with.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:28.850
Ever since Maman has been feeling...

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:32.560
Lulu, what is your dream?

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.690
Is there nothing you wish to do?

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:52.520
Please, enjoy.

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:54.280
What is this?

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:56.520
It's called miso nikomi udon.

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:59.350
Is this food appropriate for an aristocrat?

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:02.040
Good question. And it's leftovers, at that.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:04.630
Didn't ya say ya liked it before?

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:05.560
Silence!

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:09.940
It's a specialty of Nagoya, Maman's hometown. 
She taught me to make it and it's darned tasty!

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:13.880
I am certain it will be 
to your liking, Mother!

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.560
Thank you for the food.

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:22.700
How is it?

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:25.470
Acceptable.

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:31.140
I'm starvin'-nya!

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:34.470
Ikuto?

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:35.700
What is it-nya?

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:37.970
Ikuto! Hey, Ikuto!

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:47.750
That's the way! Raise 
the output higher!

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:48.610
Yes, Sir!

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:55.980
What is it?

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:58.670
The output suddenly went too high.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:00.030
Which means?

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.160
The simulation failed.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.870
Are you okay?

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:15.300
Yeah...

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:18.960
What the heck's going on-nya?

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:25.390
That concludes today's meeting.

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:26.820
Tomorrow's agenda will-

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:28.200
Pardon the intrusion.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:31.890
Lulu's grandma!

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:34.050
Why are you here?

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:38.370
I came to see if you are truly 
fit to be a friend of Lulu's.

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:44.830
Lulu-chi's grandma?

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:47.220
Yes, she came from France.

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:49.520
She is quite a high-class lady.

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:51.640
She's a descendant of a viscount!

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:55.340
Are you the one who poured this tea?

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:56.080
Yes.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.160
What temperature is the hot water?

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:59.070
Temperature?

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:01.430
It would be better to heat 
the water a touch more.

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:04.140
That way, the tea will give off its true aroma.

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:06.430
Y-Yes, I'm sorry.

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:08.910
She is truly a viscountess!

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:09.850
I must take notes.

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:11.650
Question!

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:14.670
Why is French bread so hard?

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:16.570
What grade are you in?

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:18.180
I'm in fifth grade!

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:20.650
Well then, stop acting 
like a little child!

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:22.480
But, but...

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:23.850
You'll get no sympathy from me!

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:27.200
She's scary!

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.950
Tadase, you're up against a 
descendant of a viscount.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.260
Be careful not to offend her!

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:33.140
Right.

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:35.700
Welcome to the Royal Gar-

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:37.500
You have a lock of hair sticking out.

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:39.020
I...

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:41.240
Even Tadase-kun...

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:43.850
Tadase, don't you lose! 
Go get 'er, Prince!

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:49.410
I am no prince, I am the King!

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.890
Bow your head!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.720
Hey now, Yaya!

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:56.060
It's payback!

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.960
Prostrate yourself before your King!

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.210
What insolent behavior!

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:03.220
You must respect your elders!

00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:07.480
Pardon me!

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.990
I think it is about time I left.

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:12.430
As should you!

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:15.680
Farewell!

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:20.350
Here I go!

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:22.060
Go, go!

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:25.560
Um, what is this about?

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:29.560
The children of Japan certainly 
are carefree, are they not?

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:34.950
Grandma, when I grow up, 
I want to become an artist!

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:37.690
When I grow up, I'm going 
to draw storybooks!

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:41.930
Hey, listen! When I grow up, 
I'm going to...

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:45.390
That's how Lulu used to be.

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:47.180
But now...

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:52.770
You think I'm just a fussy 
old grandma, don't you?

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:55.270
N-Not at all!

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:56.680
Well, maybe a little...

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:58.690
I can't help it.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:03.270
This is simply the nature of someone 
long-raised as a viscountess.

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:05.320
I must protect my household.

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:10.150
It is the role assigned to me 
as a viscountess since I was but a girl.

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:13.680
I was forbidden to foster my own dreams.

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:18.080
That's why I wish for Lulu 
to live a more carefree life.

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:21.660
Lulu <i>is</i> carefree.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.760
And she's good at anything she does.

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:27.080
You should see her making 
jewelry, and at Christmastime!

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:30.070
Oh, yeah! She's also good 
at umbrella spinning!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.310
Umbrella spinning?

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:32.950
More than usual...

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.060
I'm dizzy!

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:38.600
Well, there are times when she's a bit stubborn 
and not very honest with herself.

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:41.720
Is that so?

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:43.820
My Lulu is like that?

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.760
Hinamori Amu!

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:49.320
Yeah, back again...

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:52.310
She went to your school?

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:55.060
She just showed up 
and surprised everyone.

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:57.060
Why would she do such a thing?

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:59.980
You sure have a great family.

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:02.650
Your grandma and mom 
are both really awesome.

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:03.960
Maman?

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:06.380
I think she's great, and super fun.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:09.430
You don't know anything, 
and nobody asked your opinion!

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:11.600
Hey now, Lulu!

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:13.770
How could you possibly understand?

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:15.770
Aren't we friends?

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:19.620
I don't recall you ever 
becoming my friend!

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.560
What's with you 
being all buddy-buddy?

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:23.390
Don't say that!

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:26.390
That girl may be able to change Lulu.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.430
She just can't be honest with herself!

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:33.710
Honestly! Of all the nerve!

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:36.180
Lulu, calm down there.

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.970
Please take one!

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:39.360
Here you go.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:45.470
Feelin' good!

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:48.020
Feelin' good!

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:53.360
I'm going to restore Maman 
to her former radiance!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.180
That's my dream, yes I know it!

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.380
Above all else, I must get the Embryo!

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.590
Lulu...

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:06.730
I paid a visit to the school 
Lulu's friend attends.

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:12.810
I believe I now understand 
why you moved to Japan.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.890
It was all for Lulu's sake, wasn't it?

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:26.650
I think it's about time for me to leave.

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:29.300
But before I do, I am a bit famished.

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:31.460
I'll make something for you right away.

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:34.930
If you can, that dish, miso 
nikomi udon, would be splendid.

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.930
Of course!

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:42.490
There must be a lost 
soul around here somewhere.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:45.620
Lulu, don't you think you're being hasty?

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:49.690
Which should I choose? 
Yakisoba or takoyaki?

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:53.600
I wish I could eat them together.

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:55.000
You're kidding...

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.140
I can sense an amazing power from her.

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:00.360
What should I do?

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:02.010
You're lost, aren't you?

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.660
Your dream is to eat both at once.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:08.290
Well, I wouldn't really call 
it my dream or anything...

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:09.860
It's your dream, okay?!

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:10.720
Right...

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:17.820
If you wear this, you can eat 
both yakisoba <i>and</i> takoyaki.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:28.600
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:36.970
This here's real messed up!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:42.820
Character Transformation: Temple Festival Dream!

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:45.730
Amu-chan, this way!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:49.270
I want to eat takoyaki!

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:54.320
I want to eat yakisoba!

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:59.020
I want to eat them both!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:07.350
That's the way! Run wild and 
call out the Embryo!

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:09.940
What's that?

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:11.610
Amu-chan, over there!

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:14.750
What should we have next?

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:15.640
Wait!

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.900
Is this your dream?

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:22.100
That's right! I want everyone 
to eat the foods I love!

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:25.240
So that would be... takoyakisoba?

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:26.520
Wow, that's lame...

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:29.060
Lame?!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:35.450
Oh no! Amu-chan's going to be 
turned into takoyakisoba!

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:37.040
I doubt it.

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:38.890
Character Transform, Amu-chan!

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:43.310
My heart:

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:44.890
Unlock!

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:57.060
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:03.220
I won't let you belittle my dream!

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.850
Heart Speeders!

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:12.020
Wait!

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:17.610
I'm sorry about before. 
I apologize for calling your dream lame.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:20.270
It means a lot to you, right?

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:23.940
But we all have different tastes in food.

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:27.180
Just like we all have different dreams!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.920
Dreams are something you need to find on your own!

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:33.730
That's why they're fun!

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:42.930
My dream is to force people 
to eat the things I like?

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:48.270
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:54.210
Open Heart!

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:21.870
For goodness' sake, y'all ain't gonna get 
the Embryo to show up by bein' pushy!

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:22.970
Lulu?

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:29.220
Well, Grandmother, take care.

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:33.350
I forgot to fix myself up!

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:37.580
Lulu, have you settled on your dream?

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:42.000
Yes! I will follow your example, Grandmother, 
and restore Maman's former radiance!

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:45.770
Lulu, I was talking about 
what <i>you</i> want to do.

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:56.320
Don't worry. As long as you are in 
Japan, I'm sure you'll find it.

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:13.300
My... dream?

00:22:21.180 --> 00:22:25.050
We'll walk this path,

00:22:25.050 --> 00:22:28.840
no matter what may happen.

00:22:29.170 --> 00:22:33.130
Because when we combine our strength,

00:22:33.130 --> 00:22:37.050
something's bound to change!

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:52.360
You're always so quick to say "absolutely,"

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:56.730
but shouldn't you think it through a bit first?

00:22:57.100 --> 00:23:00.110
Can't you at least do that???

00:23:01.180 --> 00:23:04.860
You know, I'm starting to understand

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:08.320
the delicate movements of the heart.

00:23:08.760 --> 00:23:15.780
My own abilities aren't really all that special...

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:21.080
But even if the first shot's off the mark

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:24.950
the third'll bravely hit the bull's-eye!

00:23:27.060 --> 00:23:31.040
We'll walk this path,

00:23:31.040 --> 00:23:34.660
even if it's a steep climb.

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:39.130
Because when we put our hearts together

00:23:39.130 --> 00:23:43.080
something definitely changes!

00:23:49.730 --> 00:23:51.880
Su went off somewhere?

00:23:51.880 --> 00:23:54.290
Come on, guys, what's going on?

00:23:54.290 --> 00:23:57.210
Hmph! I don't know 
nothin' about Su, no way!

00:23:57.210 --> 00:23:58.770
I don't know nothin' neither!

00:23:58.770 --> 00:24:01.180
Though, Ran knows even less than I do!

00:24:01.440 --> 00:24:02.440
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:24:02.440 --> 00:24:03.610
You know what I mean!

00:24:03.610 --> 00:24:04.150
Hmph!

00:24:04.150 --> 00:24:05.220
Hmph! Right back at ya!

00:24:05.220 --> 00:24:08.360
G-Guys, seriously, 
what's going on here?

00:24:08.850 --> 00:24:11.140
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:11.140 --> 00:24:13.190
Classified! Make-up Recipe?

00:24:13.190 --> 00:24:16.020
Oh boy, we're cooking!

00:24:16.020 --> 00:24:17.820
Huh? What do you mean?!
